Usage: anix.exe research [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status                  
  pause                   
  resume                  
  cancel                  
  autonomy                
  budget-show             
  budget-set              
  branch-pause            
  branch-resume           
  branch-cancel           
  branch-prioritize       
  work-prioritize         
  explain                 
  request-deeper          
  request-contradictions  
  plan-revision           
  add-constraint          
  help                    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  [default: .]
      --project <PROJECT>      
      --actor <ACTOR>          [default: cli-user]
  -h, --help                   Print help
